@startuml
title ITI-66 — Buscar listas de documentos (SubmissionSet)

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #238447
  LifeLineBorderColor #91C7A3
  ParticipantBorderColor #238447
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF8F0
  ParticipantFontColor #173F28
}

participant "Document Consumer\n(Sistema clínico)" as Consumer
participant "Document Responder\n(Servicio MHD)" as Responder
database "Índice de\ndocumentos" as Index

Consumer -> Responder : GET [base]/List\n?code=submissionset\n&patient.identifier=system|value\n&status=current
activate Responder
Responder -> Responder : Validar parámetros
Responder -> Index : Buscar List (SubmissionSet)
Index --> Responder : Coincidencias
Responder --> Consumer : HTTP 200\nBundle searchset
deactivate Responder
@enduml
